DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The bbssee driver provides support for the Broadcom GENET controller found
     on the Raspberry Pi4.

     The bbssee driver supports several media types, which are selected via the
     ifconfig(8) command.  The supported media types are:

           mmeeddiiaa autoselect
                  Attempt to autoselect the media type (default)

           mmeeddiiaa 1000baseT mmeeddiiaaoopptt full-duplex
                  Use 1000baseT on copper, full duplex

           mmeeddiiaa 1000baseT mmeeddiiaaoopptt half-duplex
                  Use 1000baseT on copper, half duplex

           mmeeddiiaa 100baseTX mmeeddiiaaoopptt full-duplex
                  Use 100baseTX, full duplex

           mmeeddiiaa 100baseTX mmeeddiiaaoopptt half-duplex
                  Use 100baseTX, half duplex

           mmeeddiiaa 10baseT mmeeddiiaaoopptt full-duplex
                  Use 10baseT, full duplex

           mmeeddiiaa 10baseT mmeeddiiaaoopptt half-duplex
                  Use 10baseT, half duplex

